{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-L19-phone-screens-1-01","date":"2026-11-21","lens":"19","surface":"phone","area":"phone/screens-1","refs":["F-phone-106","F-phone-114","F-phone-137"],"severity":"S3","title":"A member can top the gym leaderboard with workouts typed in after the fact or imported from another app","what":"The gym leaderboard counts every workout saved on the phone in the last 31 days, up to 3 a day and 60,000 kg a day. A workout logged later as a past workout on the Calendar, or brought in from a Hevy or Strong file, counts the same as one done in the gym. Nothing ties a counted workout to a check-in or to the day it was really done, so a member can type one set three times a day for a month and lead the board that other members see.","expected":"Workouts typed in later or imported from another app either do not count on the gym leaderboard, or count only on days the member checked in at the gym, and the gym can see which entries were typed later.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/app/calendar.tsx:73-83","apps/mobile/src/app/calendar.tsx:128","apps/mobile/src/app/import/index.tsx:411","apps/mobile/src/shop/leaderboardSync.ts:47-51","apps/mobile/src/shop/leaderboard.ts:27-30","apps/mobile/src/shop/leaderboard.ts:44-61","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/volumeService.ts:396-401"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"board-trusts-backdated-phone-workouts","who":"members of a gym with the leaderboard","how_often":"whenever a member wants to","fix_line":"Leave typed-in-later and imported workouts out of the leaderboard, or count only check-in days","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
